topologically generated by `σ`; then `a ∈ F`, and `F ⊇ Kᵥᵗᵃᵐᵉ =: T`,
because `σ ∈ P_v = Gal(Kᵥᵃˡᵍ/T)`. So it suffices that `Fˣ` is
